    "title": "<p>TNMB staging of mycosis fungoides and S&eacute;zary syndrome according to the International Society for Cutaneous Lymphomas (ISCL) and the European Organisation for Research and Treatment of Cancer (EORTC) {17540844}</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted, with permission from Elsevier, from: Olsen E, Vonderheid E, Pimpinelli N, et al. Revisions to the staging and classification of mycosis fungoides and Sezary syndrome: a proposal of the International Society for Cutaneous Lymphomas (ISCL) and the cutaneous lymphoma task force of the European Organization of Research and Treatment of Cancer (EORTC). Blood. 2007 Sep 15;110(6):1713-22. PMID: 17540844;<br />and<br />Elder DE, Massi D, Scolyer RA, et al., editors. WHO classification of skin tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2018. (WHO classification of tumours series, 4th ed.; vol. 11). htpps://publications.iarc.fr/560.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Category</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 511.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"681\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>T/N/M/B stage</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 123.1pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"164\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Substage (if applicable)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Skin</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: -.4pt;\">Limited patches, papules, and/or plaques covering &lt;&nbsp;10% of the skin surface</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T1a</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Patch only</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T1b</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Plaque &plusmn; patch</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T2</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: -.4pt;\">Patches, papules, and/or plaques covering &ge;&nbsp;10% of the skin surface</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T2a</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Patch only</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T2b</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Plaque &plusmn; patch</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T3</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: -.4pt;\">One or more tumours (&ge;&nbsp;10&nbsp;mm diameter)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">T4</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: -.4pt;\">Confluence of erythema covering &ge;&nbsp;80% of the body surface area</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Node</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N0</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No clinically abnormal peripheral lymph nodes; biopsy not required</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clinically abnormal peripheral lymph nodes; histopathology Dutch grade&nbsp;1 or NCI LN 0&ndash;2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N1a</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clone-negative</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N1b</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clone-positive</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N2</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clinically abnormal peripheral lymph nodes; histopathology Dutch grade&nbsp;2 or NCI LN3</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N2a</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clone-negative</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N2b</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clone-positive</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 20.45pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; height: 20.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"52\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.5pt;\"><strong style=\"\">N3</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 472.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"630\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Clinically abnormal peripheral lymph nodes; histopathology Dutch grade&nbsp;3&ndash;4 or NCI LN4; clone-positive or clone-negative</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; height: 20.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 5.2pt;\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.45pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td